{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00890",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.15,
      "end_seconds": 15.04,
      "duration_seconds": 12.89,
      "text": "Good morning. I'd like to review my situation. I have stress-related stomach upset and headaches, and I want to know whether my medication is the right one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.79,
      "end_seconds": 24.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Good morning. Tell me which medication you're currently taking for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.38,
      "end_seconds": 34.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Propranolol, 40 mg, twice a day. It was started by my previous doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.9,
      "end_seconds": 41.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "How long have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.91,
      "end_seconds": 46.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "About four months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.92,
      "end_seconds": 55.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "What do you think it has done for you? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.02,
      "end_seconds": 65.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "The headaches are less frequent. The stomach is much the same. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.98,
      "end_seconds": 74.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Understood. What is going on in your life at the moment? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.54,
      "end_seconds": 88.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "I've taken on a new role at the firm, with a lot more responsibility. I'm working until nine most nights. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "That is a lot. And how are you eating and sleeping? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.51,
      "end_seconds": 108.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "I skip lunch. Dinner is late. I sleep about five hours. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.71,
      "end_seconds": 116.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Do you have any other health conditions I should record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.4,
      "end_seconds": 123.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Asthma, since childhood. It's been quiet for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.85,
      "end_seconds": 137.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.97,
      "text": "That is important, because propranolol can make asthma worse. Have you noticed any wheeze or chest tightness since starting it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.46,
      "end_seconds": 143.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, none. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.58,
      "end_seconds": 154.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "Good. I'd still like to review the choice of medicine with you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.54,
      "end_seconds": 160.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "What are my options? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.38,
      "end_seconds": 176.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.42,
      "text": "There are other medicines for preventing headaches that don't affect the lungs, and for the stomach, the first step is regular meals and managing stress. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.89,
      "end_seconds": 184.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "I'd rather avoid anything that makes my asthma worse. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.53,
      "end_seconds": 201.08,
      "duration_seconds": 13.55,
      "text": "I agree. I'd suggest we stop the propranolol gradually and switch to something else, but I'd like to check some bloods first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.76,
      "end_seconds": 207.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Which bloods? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.01,
      "end_seconds": 223.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "A full blood count and a check on your liver, thyroid and kidneys, to make sure there's nothing else behind the symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.92,
      "end_seconds": 229.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "That's reasonable. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.13,
      "end_seconds": 240.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "Please do not stop the propranolol suddenly, because that can cause problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.79,
      "end_seconds": 244.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Understood. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.94,
      "end_seconds": 259.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "I'd also like you to have a proper lunch each day, and try to leave work on time at least twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.28,
      "end_seconds": 267.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I'll try, though I make no promises. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.88,
      "end_seconds": 283.46,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, when the results are in, and we'll decide on the new medicine together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.88,
      "end_seconds": 289.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Two weeks. Thank you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.88,
      "end_seconds": 301.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "In the meantime, if you notice any wheeze or breathlessness, come in at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.12,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Will do. ~"
    }
  ]
}
